    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d736-a2">

                <pb facs="0875" n="781" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg781"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 2588.—Private.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Julio Sanguily to
                        Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Cabaña</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic">Tuesday</hi>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1895-08-20"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                20, 1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Friend</hi>: If you can get me to go to the
                    United States I’ll be very much obliged to you. Also, if you can get me to go on
                    Saturday next, because I want to go by Key West to wait for my family there that
                    will go next week. I will leave Key West in the same steamer next week.</p>
                <p>Yours, very truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Sanguily.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
